{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A restart before an unchanged renewal is sent can make recovery report it as applied, causing the manager to act on a renewal that never occurred."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"state","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A moved tip from the same owner or a malformed record can cause recovery to clear the durable release intent, losing its pending final status and checkpoint."}]}